Personal blog built with Astro in `apps/blog` and managed by pnpm and Turborepo.

## new post

`task new` opens a TUI that asks for the frontmatter (title, slug, description,
tl;dr, date, category, tags, link, og image, draft) and writes
`apps/blog/src/content/blog/<slug>.md`. Categories are read from `apps/blog/src/lib/categories.ts`.

